  "document": "Vadim Beroev\nVadim Borisovich Beroev( 1937–1972) was a Soviet theatre and film actor of Ossetian origin, best known for roles in Major Whirlwind( 1967) and No Path Through Fire( 1968). He was awarded Honored Artist of the RSFSR in 1969. He is the grandfather of actor Egor Beroev."
